  "releaseNotes": "Bug Fixes:\n- report pending outbox activations with bounded telemetry\n  Replace outbox.depth, which reported the last activation's message count,\n  with outbox.grains.pending. It counts active activations with observed\n  nonempty outboxes and reports current totals even when collection starts late.\n  Use per-type atomic totals and local transition state instead of a global\n  registry of grains or per-message recovery history. Automatic deactivation\n  cleanup removes contributions without retaining application objects.\n  Dashboards must migrate to outbox.grains.pending and use activation counts\n  rather than message counts. Inactive persisted backlog remains outside this\n  process-local metric.",
